{#
settings/_images.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Whether remote images in mail load without the "Show images" bar (#124).

A plain form that submits on change and redirects, like Disposal beside it:
the switch decides how the NEXT message is drawn, so there is nothing on this
page worth streaming back.

Off to begin with, and the hint says what turning it on gives away — that a
message was opened — and the two things it does not: the reader's address,
because images still come through plMail, and mail in Spam, which stays
blocked whatever this says.

Accepts:
  alwaysShow  bool
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

<div class="px-4 py-3">

<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_images_update') }}" data-turbo="false" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-images') }}">

    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="min-w-0">
            <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.images.always_show'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ 'settings.images.always_show_hint'|trans }}</span>
        </span>

        <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr shrink-0 rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
             role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ 'settings.images.always_show'|trans }}">
            {% for on in [true, false] %}
                <label>
                    <input type="radio" name="alwaysShow" class="peer sr-only"
                           value="{{ on ? '1' : '0' }}"
                           data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                           {{ alwaysShow == on ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <span class="{{ segText }}">
                        {{ (on ? 'settings.images.on' : 'settings.images.off')|trans }}
                    </span>
                </label>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</form>

</div>
